ster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/5628306a8bf10e55d3188c142c3ece83.poster.avif?t=1688001021\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/5628306a8bf10e55d3188c142c3ece83.webm?t=1688001021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/5628306a8bf10e55d3188c142c3ece83.mp4?t=1688001021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Fight your way through Arcade Mode, defeat all the bosses as fast as possible one at a time or all in row with a special boss at the end!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/cbf271a16dc87e4d9b5962692e2577fa.poster.avif?t=1688001021\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/cbf271a16dc87e4d9b5962692e2577fa.webm?t=1688001021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/682080/extras/cbf271a16dc87e4d9b5962692e2577fa.mp4?t=1688001021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> </li><li> Ducks... a lot of ducks!</li></ul>",
